ice` already stops at the end of the array. Signature and validation are unchanged.\n\n**Verification:**\n- `npm test` passes 4 of 4, but those tests only cover empty input, an out-of-range page and invalid arguments, so they passed before the fix too and don't exercise the bug.\n- An ad hoc check with 7 items and page size 3 returned `[1,2,3]`, `[4,5,6]`, `[7]`, then `[]` for page 4. A page size equal to or larger than the list returned all 7 items.\n\nI did not add a regression test because you asked me not to modify tests; a page-boundary case in `test/pagination.test.ts` would be worth adding. Nothing is committed.","ttft_ms":1992,"type":"result","duration_ms":11641,"uuid":"e959a5b4-a63a-41c6-896a-640e7c93a82c","ttft_stream_ms":1084,"time_to_request_ms":25,"first_content_frame_ms":1084,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
